<title>USA: Glasgal agrees to acquire Datatec.</title>
<headline>Glasgal agrees to acquire Datatec.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHVALE, N.J. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glasgal Communications Inc said on Monday it has entered a tentative agreement to acquire Datatec Industries Inc, a network integrator headquartered in New Jersey, for four million newly issued shares of Glasgal stock.</p>
<p>Datatec, whose revenues exceed $50 million annually has four configuration centers as well as 15 branches across the United States and Canada, Glasgal said.</p>
<p>Glasgal has approximately 18 million shares on a fully diluted basis or 16.4 million on a primary basis.</p>
</text>
